# age recipients (public keys) the loop state asset is encrypted to.
#
# The state database is kept as a release asset in this public repository, so
# scripts/state-asset.mjs encrypts it to every key below before upload and
# refuses to use an asset that is not encrypted. The pump, the watchdog and the
# manual re-ingest workflow decrypt it with the AGE_IDENTITY secret of
# environment `loop`, so the ingest public key (worker-kit/ingest.pub) must be
# listed here. An operator may add a key of their own to read the state
# locally. To rotate, see docs/OPERATIONS.md, "State encryption".
age15r4e7val7h8v6745nwvfvq953g4688qwegs4fzvg36atmdnrg58ss39n0e
